{"2326200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "NEO BERLIN 2087", "steam_appid": 2326200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A dark futuristic vision of Berlin</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326200/extras/91bd948caa8890249a6e7348413c1cad.poster.avif?t=1786655013\" width=592 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326200/extras/91bd948caa8890249a6e7348413c1cad.webm?t=1786655013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326200/extras/91bd948caa8890249a6e7348413c1cad.mp4?t=1786655013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2087, your origin defines your access to technology. While the ruling class started relying on the flashiest advancements, a normal person can only afford so many cyberparts. At the same time, the outcasts are plagued by malfunctioning machines roaming the land. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fault in their programming led to some robots developing a life of their own and attacking humans on sight. The city may have purged their failed experiments successfully, but the surrounding wastelands can tell another story.  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326200/extras/36d17d9396ba864c7858daa80f296d1f.poster.avif?t=1786655013\" width=592 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326200/extras/36d17d9396ba864c7858daa80f296d1f.webm?t=1786655013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326200/extras/36d17d9396ba864c7858daa80f296d1f.mp4?t=1786655013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rich rule from luxurious comfort inside a new version of the Berlin walls, which shield them from both harsh dystopian environments and the rest of humanity fighting for resources. Various settlements are scattered throughout the barren lands, led by rivaling factions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your place in this world</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nolan, a ranking detective in the Neo Berlin Police Department, is tasked with the daunting mission of finding and safeguarding the Police Chief's daughter.  With his state-of-the-art technology and unique abilities, Nolan embarks on a perilous journey to locate Natalie as quickly as possible and solve the mystery behind her father's sudden murder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326200/extras/9272f6171d1d2ccff9cdfc7d4beb711f.poster.avif?t=1786655013\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326200/extras/9272f6171d1d2ccff9cdfc7d4beb711f.webm?t=1786655013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326200/extras/9272f6171d1d2ccff9cdfc7d4beb711f.mp4?t=1786655013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each step he takes brings him closer to a sinister conspiracy that threatens to consume him and the entire city. When Nolan finally comes face to face with the fiercely independent and resourceful Natalie, he realizes that their fates are more deeply intertwined than the detective previously assumed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326200/extras/bbf900f26416beb0a9b0a533180bd262.poster.avif?t=1786655013\" width=592 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326200/extras/bbf900f26416beb0a9b0a533180bd262.webm?t=1786655013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326200/extras/bbf900f26416beb0a9b0a533180bd262.mp4?t=1786655013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive the last moments of victims: Step right into their shoes and pay close attention to their past unfolding in front of your eyes. Use your unique ability to understand human behavior, reconstruct memories, and find essential clues to solve cases. Navigate complex social and political landscapes to find out what really happened. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be stealthy or confrontational</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326200/extras/2a1acdabe3dd467c4e659f0304667767.poster.avif?t=1786655013\" width=592 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326200/extras/2a1acdabe3dd467c4e659f0304667767.webm?t=1786655013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326200/extras/2a1acdabe3dd467c4e659f0304667767.mp4?t=1786655013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a seasoned detective, stealth comes naturally to you. Sneak through dangerous locations, stay out of sight, and eliminate threats with silent weapons while using the seamless switch between first- and third-person perspectives to gain the tactical advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326200/extras/2d035d9a06b88622563d03579d8dbe1a.poster.avif?t=1786655013\" width=592 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326200/extras/2d035d9a06b88622563d03579d8dbe1a.webm?t=1786655013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326200/extras/2d035d9a06b88622563d03579d8dbe1a.mp4?t=1786655013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you fail to stay undiscovered, or choose to live a risky life and jump right into action-packed combat on purpose, you will have to survive close quarter fights, weaving through both blades and bullets. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your choices matter</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your pick from a wide range of weaponry and customize your skill set to fit your personal playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326200/extras/0971b2b1421e35aee8954b3cca2036c0.poster.avif?t=1786655013\" width=592 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326200/extras/0971b2b1421e35aee8954b3cca2036c0.webm?t=1786655013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326200/extras/0971b2b1421e35aee8954b3cca2036c0.mp4?t=1786655013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steer conversations in your favor or let your actions speak for themselves. Your behavior has an influence on both the characters around you and how the story unfolds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326200/extras/987175e515266569ec8b5e4f23a35268.webp?t=1786655013\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326200/extras/987175e515266569ec8b5e4f23a35268.poster.avif?t=1786655013\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=250 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What are you waiting for? Make the city yours and fight for the justice your home deserves. </p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A dark futuristic vision of Berlin</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326200/extras/91bd948caa8890249a6e7348413c1cad.poster.avif?t=1786655013\" width=592 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326200/extras/91bd948caa8890249a6e7348413c1cad.webm?t=1786655013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326200/extras/91bd948caa8890249a6e7348413c1cad.mp4?t=1786655013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2087, your origin defines your access to technology. While the ruling class started relying on the flashiest advancements, a normal person can only afford so many cyberparts. At the same time, the outcasts are plagued by malfunctioning machines roaming the land. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fault in their programming led to some robots developing a life of their own and attacking humans on sight. The city may have purged their failed experiments successfully, but the surrounding wastelands can tell another story.  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326200/extras/36d17d9396ba864c7858daa80f296d1f.poster.avif?t=1786655013\" width=592 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap